# The TCR material curves are imported straight into EScribe on Windows. Commit
# their bytes verbatim so a raw download from GitHub carries native Windows
# (CRLF) line endings rather than git's normalized LF.
*.csv -text

# EScribe containers are zips whose inner XML carries a UTF-8 BOM and CRLF
# throughout. A single changed byte makes EScribe refuse the whole file with
# only "Failed to open file", so keep every filter off them.
*.ecigtheme   -text
*.ecig        -text
*.ecigprofile -text
